<div class="simplesocialbutton ssb-button-twitter"><!-- Twitter--><a href="https://twitter.com/share" class="twitter-share-button" data-text="Knowing yourself is key." data-url="http://civgene.matthewnewhall.com/archives/32" rel="nofollow"></a></div>
